{"id":"f952ca09ccc601e4","group":"17","path":"17/17-prop-finite-elementary-equivalence.md","title":"Finite Models: Equivalence and Isomorphism","display":"prop-finite-elementary-equivalence — Finite Models: Equivalence and Isomorphism","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Model Theory (Chang & Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)","book_abbrev":"17","label":"17-prop-finite-elementary-equivalence","aliases":["17-prop-finite-elementary-equivalence"],"display":"prop-finite-elementary-equivalence — Finite Models: Equivalence and Isomorphism","label_origin":"local-descriptive-label","source_section":"1.3","source_result":"Proposition 1.3.19; Exercise 1.3.4","source_pages_print":[32,34],"source_pages_djvu":[48,50],"source_verification":"statement-compared; proof left as exercise in book and supplied locally","verification_date":"2026-10-13","depends_on":["[[17-df-embedding]]","[[17-df-elementary-equivalence]]","[[17-lem-isomorphism-satisfaction]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Model Theory (Chang &amp; Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"17"},{"key":"label","html":"17-prop-finite-elementary-equivalence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>17-prop-finite-elementary-equivalence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-finite-elementary-equivalence — Finite Models: Equivalence and Isomorphism"},{"key":"label_origin","html":"local-descriptive-label"},{"key":"source_section","html":"1.3"},{"key":"source_result","html":"Proposition 1.3.19; Exercise 1.3.4"},{"key":"source_pages_print","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>32</span><span>34</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pages_djvu","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>48</span><span>50</span></div>"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"statement-compared; proof left as exercise in book and supplied locally"},{"key":"verification_date","html":"2026-10-13"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3482e8f05d02c6f0\" href=\"?note=3482e8f05d02c6f0\" title=\"17-df-embedding\">17-df-embedding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"bdfdb62527f9710d\" href=\"?note=bdfdb62527f9710d\" title=\"17-df-elementary-equivalence\">17-df-elementary-equivalence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3784f7fc076663f9\" href=\"?note=3784f7fc076663f9\" title=\"17-lem-isomorphism-satisfaction\">17-lem-isomorphism-satisfaction</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\">\\(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=|\\mathfrak A|\">\\(A=|\\mathfrak A|\\)</span> 是有限非空集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B=|\\mathfrak B|\">\\(B=|\\mathfrak B|\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 允许无限多个非逻辑符号。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Emb}_L\">\\(\\operatorname{Emb}_L\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3482e8f05d02c6f0\" href=\"?note=3482e8f05d02c6f0\" title=\"17-df-embedding\">17-df-embedding</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_L\">\\(\\equiv_L\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"bdfdb62527f9710d\" href=\"?note=bdfdb62527f9710d\" title=\"17-df-elementary-equivalence\">17-df-elementary-equivalence</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\\equiv_L\\mathfrak B\n\\quad\\leftrightarrow\\quad\n\\exists f\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{Emb}_L(f,\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)\\land f[A]=B\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathfrak A\\equiv_L\\mathfrak B\n\\quad\\leftrightarrow\\quad\n\\exists f\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{Emb}_L(f,\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)\\land f[A]=B\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>新建前搜索了本册全部原子、MOC/glossary 中有限模型、初等等价、同构及 Proposition 1.3.19；有限模型饱和性已有节点，本命题未找到重复项。</p>\n<p>反向由 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"3784f7fc076663f9\" href=\"?note=3784f7fc076663f9\" title=\"17-lem-isomorphism-satisfaction\">17-lem-isomorphism-satisfaction</a>。正向：令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|A|=n\">\\(|A|=n\\)</span>；“恰有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 个元素”的一阶句子迫使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|B|=n\">\\(|B|=n\\)</span>。若不存在同构，则对有限多个双射 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:A\\to B\">\\(f:A\\to B\\)</span>，各选择一个关系、函数或常元的保持失败见证。这只使用有限子语言 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_0\\subseteq L\">\\(L_0\\subseteq L\\)</span>。枚举 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>，将 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\\upharpoonright L_0\">\\(\\mathfrak A\\upharpoonright L_0\\)</span> 的全部关系真值、函数表与常元取值写成有限合取，再加上互异及穷尽载体条件，得到一个一阶句子：它在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\">\\(\\mathfrak A\\)</span> 中真，在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak B\">\\(\\mathfrak B\\)</span> 中假，矛盾。因此存在普通同构。</p>\n<p>此证明特意允许无限语言；不能直接把全部语言的原子图写成一个无限合取的一阶句子。原书 p.32 陈述此命题，p.34 将证明及无限模型反例列为 Exercise 1.3.4；本地证明已补全，未将该习题标成原书已证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-embedding","status":"resolved","id":"3482e8f05d02c6f0","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-embedding]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-elementary-equivalence","status":"resolved","id":"bdfdb62527f9710d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-elementary-equivalence]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-lem-isomorphism-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"3784f7fc076663f9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-lem-isomorphism-satisfaction]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-embedding","status":"resolved","id":"3482e8f05d02c6f0","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)$；$A=|\\mathfrak A|$ 是有限非空集合，$B=|\\mathfrak B|$。$L$ 允许无限多个非逻辑符号。$\\operatorname{Emb}_L$ 见 [[17-df-embedding]]，$\\equiv_L$ 见 [[17-df-elementary-equivalence]]。","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-elementary-equivalence","status":"resolved","id":"bdfdb62527f9710d","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)$；$A=|\\mathfrak A|$ 是有限非空集合，$B=|\\mathfrak B|$。$L$ 允许无限多个非逻辑符号。$\\operatorname{Emb}_L$ 见 [[17-df-embedding]]，$\\equiv_L$ 见 [[17-df-elementary-equivalence]]。","embed":false},{"target":"17-lem-isomorphism-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"3784f7fc076663f9","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"反向由 [[17-lem-isomorphism-satisfaction]]。正向：令 $|A|=n$；“恰有 $n$ 个元素”的一阶句子迫使 $|B|=n$。若不存在同构，则对有限多个双射 $f:A\\to B$，各选择一个关系、函数或常元的保持失败见证。这只使用有限子语言 $L_0\\subseteq L$。枚举 $A$，将 $\\mathfrak A\\upharpoonright L_0$ 的全部关系真值、函数表与常元取值写成有限合取，再加上互异及穷尽载体条件，得到一个一阶句子：它在 $\\mathfrak A$ 中真，在 $\\mathfrak B$ 中假，矛盾。因此存在普通同构。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)","display":false},{"tex":"A=|\\mathfrak A|","display":false},{"tex":"B=|\\mathfrak B|","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Emb}_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\equiv_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak A\\equiv_L\\mathfrak B\n\\quad\\leftrightarrow\\quad\n\\exists f\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{Emb}_L(f,\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)\\land f[A]=B\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"|A|=n","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"|B|=n","display":false},{"tex":"f:A\\to B","display":false},{"tex":"L_0\\subseteq L","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak A\\upharpoonright L_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak B","display":false}],"bytes":2255,"backlinks":[{"id":"2c98c9e634ff4b44","anchor":"ref-248","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[17-prop-finite-elementary-equivalence]]\n[[17-prop-finite-model-saturation]]\n[[17-prop-formula-cardinality]]\n[[17-prop-generated-filter]]"}],"outgoing":["3482e8f05d02c6f0","bdfdb62527f9710d","3784f7fc076663f9"]}